{
  "slug": "negatives",
  "title": "Negatives",
  "titleRu": "Отрицание",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "explanation",
      "md": "Отрицание в Present Simple собирается не из not у глагола, а из **don't / doesn't** и словарной формы.\n\n**I / you / we / they** берут **don't** (или do not). **he / she / it** берут **doesn't** (или does not). **-s** с основного глагола снимается: оно уже внутри **doesn't**.\n\nПолные формы **do not** и **does not** значат то же самое. В разговоре почти всегда don't и doesn't."
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "headers": ["Person", "Negative"],
      "rows": [
        ["I / you / we / they", "don't work"],
        ["he / she / it", "doesn't work"]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "example",
      "en": "I don't like coffee.",
      "ru": "Я не люблю кофе."
    },
    {
      "type": "example",
      "en": "She doesn't live here.",
      "ru": "Она здесь не живёт."
    },
    {
      "type": "pitfall",
      "ruleId": "ps-negative-doesnt",
      "md": "После **doesn't** глагол без **-s**: she doesn't like, не she doesn't likes.\n\nДва **-s** подряд (doesn't likes) — частая ошибка: лицо уже отмечено в doesn't, глаголу больше нечего добавлять."
    },
    {
      "type": "exercise",
      "id": "ps-neg-01",
      "ruleId": "ps-negative-dont",
      "kind": "choice",
      "prompt": "They ___ in London.",
      "options": ["don't live", "doesn't live", "don't lives"],
      "answer": "don't live"
    },
    {
      "type": "exercise",
      "id": "ps-neg-02",
      "ruleId": "ps-negative-doesnt",
      "kind": "choice",
      "prompt": "He ___ tea.",
      "options": ["don't like", "doesn't like", "doesn't likes"],
      "answer": "doesn't like"
    },
    {
      "type": "exercise",
      "id": "ps-neg-03",
      "ruleId": "ps-negative-doesnt",
      "kind": "pick-sentence",
      "prompt": "Which sentence is correct?",
      "options": ["She doesn't likes it.", "She doesn't like it."],
      "answer": "She doesn't like it."
    },
    {
      "type": "exercise",
      "id": "ps-neg-04",
      "ruleId": "ps-negative-dont",
      "kind": "gap",
      "prompt": "I ___ football. (do not play)",
      "answer": "don't play",
      "accept": ["do not play"]
    },
    {
      "type": "exercise",
      "id": "ps-neg-05",
      "ruleId": "ps-negative-doesnt",
      "kind": "transform",
      "prompt": "Make this negative.",
      "source": "She works here.",
      "answer": "She doesn't work here.",
      "accept": ["She does not work here."]
    },
    {
      "type": "exercise",
      "id": "ps-neg-06",
      "ruleId": "ps-negative-dont",
      "kind": "transform",
      "prompt": "Make this negative.",
      "source": "We like this song.",
      "answer": "We don't like this song.",
      "accept": ["We do not like this song."]
    }
  ]
}
